<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<div class="layout">
   <header class="search-section">
      <img class="h-8 w-auto lg:h-8 xl:h-10 2xl:h-14" src="https://b.zmtcdn.com/web_assets/8313a97515fcb0447d2d77c276532a511583262271.png" loading="eager" height="30" alt="Zomato">
      <input type="text" id="sopSearch" placeholder="Search scenario (e.g., 'mall', 'device', 'spillage')..." onkeyup="filterSOP()">
      <a href="/"><i class="fa fa-home" style="font-size:36px; color:white;"></i></a>
   </header>



      <% if (typeof mode !== 'undefined' && mode === 'edit') { %>
      <div id="sop-edit-toolbar">
         <span style="font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#cbd5e1;">✏️ EDIT MODE</span>
         <span style="opacity:.6;font-size:11px;">Drag cards to reorder · Click ✏️ to edit a block</span>
         <span id="draft-status-msg" style="margin-left:20px;opacity:.8;font-size:11px;color:#a7f3d0;">Draft up-to-date</span>
         <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;position:relative;">
             <button id="sop-undo-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-secondary" onclick="undo()" disabled title="Undo last change"><i class="fa fa-undo"></i></button>
             <button id="sop-redo-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-secondary" onclick="redo()" disabled title="Redo last change"><i class="fa fa-repeat"></i></button>
             <button id="sop-add-cat-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-purple" onclick="openCategoryModal()">＋ Add Category</button>
             <button id="sop-save-layout-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-slate">💾 Save Draft</button>
             <a href="/<%= lob %>/sop/preview" target="_blank" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-slate" style="text-decoration:none;"><i class="fa fa-external-link"></i> Live Preview</a>
             <button id="sop-publish-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-green">🚀 Publish Draft</button>
             <button id="sop-options-btn" class="sop-toolbar-btn btn-secondary" title="Options"><i class="fa fa-ellipsis-v"></i></button>
             <div id="sop-options-dropdown" style="display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;right:0px;background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #475569;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 0;width:170px;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);z-index:2000;">
                 <button onclick="openVersionHistoryModal()" style="display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:8px 15px;background:none;border:none;color:#f1f5f9;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">
                     📜 View Update History
                 </button>
                 <button onclick="openMonacoCodeView()" style="display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:8px 15px;background:none;border:none;color:#f1f5f9;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">
                     💻 Code Custom SOP
                 </button>
             </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   <% } %>

   <main class="sop-container" id="sopDynamicContainer">
      <% if (categories && categories.length > 0) { %>
         <% categories.forEach(cat => { %>
            <div class="category-block" data-category="<%= cat.title %>">
               <div class="category-title">
                  <%= cat.title %>
                  <% if (cat.phase) { %>
                     <span>(Phase: <%= cat.phase %>)</span>
                  <% } %>
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="device issues merchant restaurant unable see order prompt cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Restaurant Device Issues</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant can't see or process the order</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Send Prompt &amp; Cancel</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Send prompt and select cancellation.
• Prompt example: Upon checking, the restaurant informed that they are facing device issues due to which they are unable to process your order.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="device issues delivery partner unable see order details reassign cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">DP Device Issues</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP can't see order details on their device</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Reassign or Cancel</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Try to reassign first.
• If driver not available → Cancel.
• Prompt example: The delivery partner is facing device issues due to which he is unable to see your order at the moment.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 6 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="out of stock missing partial prepaid cod alternate item escalate cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Out of Stock / Missing Items</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant confirms items unavailable or partial</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-esc">Escalate to Agent</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
1. If MX confirms items are partially missing (some items in the order are missing) → Escalate to agent.
   Example: If a customer ordered two items and only one can be prepared, the case must be escalated.

2. If COD order → Select cancellation.
   If prepaid order → Check with the restaurant partner if an alternate item can be prepared.
   • If NO → Cancel.
   • If YES (alternate item can be prepared) → Escalate to agent.

Note: If DP stated that the item is out of stock, agent must confirm this from MX.
• If restaurant unresponsive → Select cancellation.
• If MX said CX denied to accept alternate of the order → Select Cancellation.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 7 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="marked ready early by mistake restaurant priority prompt" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Marked Ready Early (by Mistake)</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant marked order ready prematurely</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-wait">Send Prompt</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Ask the restaurant to prepare the order on priority and ask how much time it will take.
• Create a prompt and mention the delay reason.
• Prompt example: The restaurant has marked the order ready before time by mistake but we have asked them to speed up the process for you.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 8 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="outlet closed restaurant cancelled dp voc unresponsive" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Outlet Closed</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant confirmed closed or unresponsive</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Select Cancellation</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• If confirmed (with restaurant) → Select cancellation.
• If restaurant is unresponsive → Go with the DP VOC and select cancellation.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 9 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="wrong restaurant address cancel dp voc unresponsive confirmed" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Wrong Restaurant Address</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant address is incorrect or mismatched</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Select Cancellation</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• If confirmed (with restaurant) → Select cancellation.
• If restaurant is unresponsive → Go with the DP VOC and select cancellation.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 10 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="mall order inside premises gate delivery partner waiting food ready prep end 5 mins" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Mall Orders</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Order falls inside a mall / restricted premises</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-wait">Prompt &amp; Compensate</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Call the restaurant. If they don't respond, call the Delivery Partner.
• Ask the DP for the estimation and create a prompt. Compensate according to the delay.
• Prompt example: Since the order falls inside a mall's premises, the delivery partner is not allowed to enter the gate. Trying our best to expedite the order for you.
• In case DP is waiting outside the mall, food is ready but DP is waiting outside → Set status: Prep End, expected time: 5 mins (from 17-Apr-26: Mall order food waiting = Expected 5 mins).
               </div>
            </div>

         </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ CATEGORY 2: AWAITING PICKUP ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
      <div class="category-block">
         <div class="category-title">02. AWAITING PICK UP <span>(Phase: Pre-Transit)</span></div>
         <div class="sop-grid">

            <!-- 11 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="awaiting pickup restaurant confirms picked up status 30 mins wait escalate reassign" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Awaiting Pickup — Order Picked but Status Not Updated</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Restaurant says order picked, status still shows Awaiting Pickup</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-wait">Wait or Escalate</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
Scenario 1: Restaurant confirms order already picked up but status shows "Awaiting Pickup":
• If less than 30 minutes → Send wait prompt.
• If more than 30 minutes → Escalate the case.

Scenario 2: Both DP &amp; MX unresponsive (Status: Awaiting Pickup):
• If delay &gt;30 mins → Reassign the order.
• If no rider available for reassignment → Escalate the case.

Scenario 3: Delay &gt;37 mins, status still "Waiting for Pickup", DP en route to restaurant:
• Contact both DP and MX. Reassign the order to another available DP.

Scenario 4: DP &amp; MX unresponsive but DP was just assigned a few minutes ago:
• Call the DP. If still unresponsive → Mention in PN: "DP recently assigned by backend and is on the way to the restaurant; hence escalated" (only if delay &gt;30 mins).

Case 1 – DP denies delivery (vehicle / accident / rain):
• Try to reassign. If DP unavailable → Cancel the order (applies pre &amp; post pickup; time does not matter).
• Note: In rain, another DP can pick if available.

Case 2 – DP says no longer working with Zomato:
• Try to reassign. If DP unavailable → Escalate the case.

Case 3 – Mismatch in DP &amp; MX response (Delay &gt;30 mins):
• DP: Food not ready / MX: Food is ready → Reconnect with DP and confirm order is ready for pickup.

Case 4 – DP says "just reached the restaurant":
• Expected time: 2–3 minutes. Order status: Arrived at restaurant.

Case 5 – Delay &lt;30 mins, DP &amp; MX unresponsive, food ready &amp; DP waiting at restaurant:
• Set order status: Preparation End. Set expected time: 5–10 minutes.

Case 6 – DP cannot see order on device:
• Ask DP to refresh the app. If still not visible → Reassign. If fails → Cancel.

If MX unresponsive and DP unsure about prep time and delay reason:
• If delay &gt;40 mins → Escalate the case.

Scenario: DP &amp; MX both unresponsive, delay &lt;30 mins:
• Set order status: Preparation End. Expected time: up to 5 mins.
• Note: Do not add expected time less or more than 5 mins.

Scenario: Delay &gt;30 mins, DP says caught by police (Status: Awaiting Pickup):
• First reassign. If no DP available → Escalate.

Scenario: DP confirms will reach restaurant and gives time (e.g., 20 mins):
• Give waiting prompt. Compensate as per delay.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 12 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="picked another dp awaiting pickup mx prepare again cancel prompt" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Picked by Another DP</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Current DP says another DP already picked the order</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Check MX — Cancel if Needed</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
If the current DP says another delivery partner has already picked up the order:
• Call MX and confirm if the order can be prepared again.
• If MX confirms YES (can prepare again) → Provide waiting prompt. Compensate as per delay.
• If MX confirms NO (cannot prepare again) → Cancel the order.
• Cancellation Prompt: The order was picked up by a different delivery partner, which caused a delay. Unfortunately, the restaurant is unable to prepare it again, so the order has been cancelled.
• If MX is unresponsive → Check with the DP for confirmation.
               </div>
            </div>

         </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ CATEGORY 3: POST-PICKUP CONCERNS ══════════════════════════════ -->
      <div class="category-block">
         <div class="category-title">03. POST-PICKUP CONCERNS <span>(Phase: In-Transit)</span></div>
         <div class="sop-grid">

            <!-- 13 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="dp not responding calls tracking movement map double tracking pn compensate escalate 30 mins ur" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">DP Not Responding to Calls</div>
               <div class="card-cond">Post-pickup, DP unreachable but order in transit</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-esc">Track &amp; Escalate if &gt;30m</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Track the DP's location from the map and see if he is moving. Include double tracking details in PN.
• Prompt: The delivery partner is not responding to our calls at the moment but we can track his movement and he is getting closer to your location.
• Compensate according to the delay. Mention delay time and tracking details in private notes (PN).

If DP is not moving (order is Picked Up):
• If delay &lt;30 mins → Ask customer to wait.
• If delay &gt;30 mins → Escalate.

In DP UR case: Time doesn't matter — if KMs are not reducing, escalate above 30 mins delay.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 14 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="dp unable deliver after pickup vehicle mobile app issue reassign cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">DP Unable to Deliver After Pickup</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP says cannot deliver — vehicle, mobile, or app issue</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Reassign or Cancel</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• DP says order is picked up but unable to deliver (reasons: vehicle issue, mobile issue, app issue, etc.).
• Check with reassignment first.
• If reassignment not happening → Proceed with cancellation.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 15 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="dp unable find customer location map real time update prompt escalate" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">DP Unable to Find Customer Location</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP struggling to locate delivery address</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-esc">Assist or Escalate</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
• Ask the DP to call the customer and get a real-time update.
• Prompt: The delivery partner is facing difficulty to locate your location as per the map. He should be reaching you anytime now. You can also try calling him.
• If the DP needs assistance → Escalate the case to an agent.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 16 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="traffic festive delay cancellation deliver prompt compensate" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Traffic / Festive Delay</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP delayed due to traffic or festive conditions</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-wait">Prompt &amp; Compensate</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
Case 1 – If order can be delivered:
• Prompt: Due to a festive occasion, the delivery partner is taking longer than usual to reach your location.
• Compensate according to the delay.

Case 2 – If the order cannot be delivered:
• Prompt: Due to a festive occasion, the delivery partner is taking longer than usual and is unable to move.
• Select cancellation.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 17 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="post pickup order transfer previous dp unresponsive reassign new dp switched off escalate cancel" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Post-Pickup Order Transfer — Old DP Unresponsive</div>
               <div class="card-cond">New DP assigned but old DP unresponsive / unavailable</div>
               <span class="action-tag tag-cancel">Reassign / Cancel / Escalate</span>
               <div class="expand-hint"><i class="fa fa-expand"></i> View full SOP</div>
               <div class="card-detail-data" style="display:none">
Prompt: The primary delivery partner is not responding due to which the new assigned partner is unable to collect the order. Select cancellation.

Case 1 – New DP says no old DP available, number is switched off:
• Agent must attempt call from his/her end. If old DP number is switched off → Cancel.

Case 2 – New DP says no old DP available, number is unresponsive but calls connecting:
• Escalate the ticket.

Case 3 – Both DPs not responding to calls:
• Escalate the ticket.
               </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 18 -->
            <div class="sop-card" data-tags="customer address mismatch dp deliver updated whatsapp location long distance cancel escalate" onclick="openModal(this)">
               <div class="card-header">Customer Address Mismatch</div>
               <div class="card-cond">DP cannot deliver due to incorrect address</div>
